B.apW=s(["Voice input now builds daily, interval, or monthly recurrences step by step, including day restrictions and an optional end date.","Desktop wizard navigation supports Enter and left/right arrows for dates, choices, linked payables, and final saving.","Text fields keep normal caret movement and only move between steps at the left or right text boundary."],t.s)
